  "_comment": [
    "Campaign-wide wavefront inventory for the libgit2 wrap campaign 20261008-170008:",
    "the libgit2.so link unit (src/libgit2, src/util and the vendored deps compiled",
    "into it) and the installed public headers, deprecated ones excluded.",
    "deprecated.h, cred_helpers.h and sys/cred.h are deprecated shims; stdint.h is",
    "MSVC-only. Inline deprecated blocks vanish under GIT_DEPRECATE_HARD in the traced",
